{
~A. 4#This divides correctly but uses the wrong sign.
~B. -18#This subtracts instead of dividing.
~C. 30#This adds absolute values instead of dividing.
=D. -4#Correct. Different signs make a negative quotient, and 24 / 6 = 4.
}

::ALG1_U01_L02_Quiz_Q16::
